    [CI] main2main: parameterize the fork account via repository variables (#18034)
    
    `dev-submitter` is suspended; move the flow to submitter-dev and make
    the identity overridable without editing this file:
    
    - `HEAD_FORK` now comes from the `MAIN2MAIN_HEAD_FORK` repository
    variable (default submitter-dev/vllm-ascend), consumed by the flow code
    under its existing `$HEAD_FORK` name.
    - Commit identity (git user.name/user.email) comes from the
    `MAIN2MAIN_GIT_NAME / MAIN2MAIN_GIT_EMAIL` variables.
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
